At the pulse of transfection -
make your cardiovascular research 
now easier and more efficient.

Dear Dr. Symanzik, 

When it comes to transfecting primary cells you want to use 
state-of-the-art equipment to achieve the best results, 
right? Well, now you can make your research easier and more 
efficient with the unique Nucleofector technology.

Did you know that you can now benefit from

* a non-viral technology,
* reproducibly high efficiencies and
* ready-to-use optimized protocols, 

all at the same time? 

With the Nucleofector technology you can deliver DNA straight 
into the nucleus of primary cells and cell lines.

Just choose the ready-to-use kit for your cell type and use 
it combination with the Nucleofector device to transfect a 
multitude of primary cell types:

* AoSMC - human aortic smooth muscle cells
* CD34+ - hematopoietic progenitor cells
* HCAEC - human coronary artery endothelial cells
* Cardiomyocytes, rat (coming soon)
* HMVEC-L - human microvascular endothelial cell, lung
* HUVEC - human umbilical vein endothelial cells
* MSC - human mesenchymal stem cells 

Are you working with cell lines? Simply use the Cell Line 
Optimization Nucleofector Kit to determine the best transfection 
conditions for virtually any cell line within two weeks.

For more information check http://www.amaxa.com/cardio or enter 
your contact details at 
http://www.amaxa.com/contact/service/generalquest/
To arrange a test use simply contact the amaxa Scientific Support 
Team at http://www.amaxa.com/contact/service/. 

With best regards

 
Wolfgang Kintzel
VP International Marketing

